        <mxCell id="entityLegend" value="&lt;b&gt;Relationship semantics&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;GameController owns the player and gameplay collections.&#xa;Enemy polymorphism occurs through List&lt;EnemySpaceship&gt;.&#xa;PlayerSpaceship creates ShipAnimator, but receives InputManager and optional SpriteSheet references.&#xa;Explosion owns exactly 14 nested Particle objects." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#F7F9FB;strokeColor=#7A8793;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="e1">
